From 23476aaee360d5176533e574bae7f855f24811fb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "hk.wang" <hkcqwang@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 11 May 2026 17:58:15 +0800
Subject: [PATCH]     feat(skill): address PR #113 review comments     *
 feat(skill): Load skill metadata first, then dynamically fetch full content
 on-demand to optimize context window usage.     - When the gateway starts, it
 only loads the skill yaml header initially. When using the skill, it loads
 the complete content.     - After the gateway is started, when the local
 skill.md file is updated, the skill metadata will be updated. However, this
 feature is not currently supported.     * feat(rpc): restruct rpc_handler.cpp
     - refactored RPC handlers into modular files, drastically reducing
 rpc_handler.cpp function size and improving maintainability.

    Made-with: Qoder
